{"id":68416,"date":"2025-10-13T08:42:33","date_gmt":"2025-10-13T07:42:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68416"},"modified":"2026-10-16T21:13:43","modified_gmt":"2026-10-16T20:13:43","slug":"sao-silvestre-de-famalicao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-de-famalicao\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o 2026<\/strong> (10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se na noite de quarta-feira, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">23 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, nas ruas iluminadas de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong> (distrito de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Braga<\/strong>). Organizada pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Eug\u00e9nios Health &amp; SPA Club (EUG\u00c9NIOS HC)<\/strong> e pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Junta de N\u00facleo do CNE de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong>, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o e da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga, esta prova noturna \u00e9 uma das mais emblem\u00e1ticas e participadas do calend\u00e1rio minhoto de fim de ano. Prepara o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e descobre mais eventos no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida e chegada \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">21:30<\/strong> na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Rua Manuel Pinto de Sousa<\/strong>, em frente aos Pa\u00e7os do Concelho (<strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong>), o evento \u00e9 composto pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (destinada a atletas federados e n\u00e3o federados nascidos em 2008 e anos anteriores, distribu\u00eddos pelos escal\u00f5es Sub-23, Seniores, M\/F40, M\/F50 e M\/F60+) e pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini \/ Caminhada de 4 km<\/strong>, aberta a participantes de todas as idades num ambiente festivo natal\u00edcio.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Limitada a 7000 participantes no conjunto das duas dist\u00e2ncias, a prova assegura t-shirt oficial, dorsal com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica (nos 10 km) e seguro desportivo, premiando os tr\u00eas primeiros classificados da geral individual masculina e feminina sob a arbitragem do Conselho Regional de Arbitragem da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">23 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 21:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o, Braga<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-widt