x; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/s3.lap2go.com\/events\/2026\/ss-famalicao\/Regulamento-ss-famalicao-2026-min.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 21:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 30\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12 a 10\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini \/ Caminhada 4 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 21:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00danica:<\/strong> 7,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 10\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o realiza-se na quarta-feira, 23 de dezembro de 2026, com partida \u00e0s 21:30 na Rua Manuel Pinto de Sousa, em frente \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Corrida de 10 km as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es custam 12,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 31 de outubro (1\u00aa fase), 15,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 30 de novembro (2\u00aa fase) e 17,50 \u20ac de 1 a 10 de dezembro (3\u00aa fase). Na Mini \/ Caminhada de 4 km o valor \u00e9 fixo de 7,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 ao fecho das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es a 10 de dezembro de 2026 (limite global de 7000 vagas).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento do kit de atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento de kits decorre nos dias 21 e 22 de dezembro, das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00, nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do Eug\u00e9nios Health &#038; SPA Club (Calend\u00e1rio, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o), e no dia da prova (23 de dezembro), das 14:00 \u00e0s 19:00, no Secretariado situado em frente \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem pode participar e quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es da prova de 10 km?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Corrida de 10 km podem participar atletas federados e n\u00e3o federados nascidos em 2008 e anos anteriores, distribu\u00eddos pelos escal\u00f5es Sub-23, S\u00e9nior (24\u201339 anos), M\/F40 (40\u201349 anos), M\/F50 (50\u201359 anos) e M\/F60 (60+ anos), sendo premiados os 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina. A Caminhada de 4 km \u00e9 aberta a todas as idades.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite da prova e quem organiza o evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Tanto a Corrida de 10 km como a Mini Caminhada de 4 km t\u00eam uma dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima de 2 horas (2h00). O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo Eug\u00e9nios Health &#038; SPA Club (EUG\u00c9NIOS HC) e pela Junta de N\u00facleo do CNE de Famalic\u00e3o, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o e da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-23\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o, Braga\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Eug\u00e9nios Health & SPA Club (EUG\u00c9NIOS HC) e Junta de N\u00facleo do CNE Famalic\u00e3o\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e a que horas se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o realiza-se na quarta-feira, 23 de dezembro de 2026, com partida \u00e0s 21:30 na Rua Manuel Pinto de Sousa, em frente \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na Corrida de 10 km as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es custam 12,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 31 de outubro (1\u00aa fase), 15,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 30 de novembro (2\u00aa fase) e 17,50 \u20ac de 1 a 10 de dezembro (3\u00aa fase). Na Mini \/ Caminhada de 4 km o valor \u00e9 fixo de 7,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 ao fecho das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es a 10 de dezembro de 2026 (limite global de 7000 vagas).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento do kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento de kits decorre nos dias 21 e 22 de dezembro, das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00, nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do Eug\u00e9nios Health & SPA Club (Calend\u00e1rio, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o), e no dia da prova (23 de dezembro), das 14:00 \u00e0s 19:00, no Secretariado situado em frente \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem pode participar e quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es da prova de 10 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na Corrida de 10 km podem participar atletas federados e n\u00e3o federados nascidos em 2008 e anos anteriores, distribu\u00eddos pelos escal\u00f5es Sub-23, S\u00e9nior (24\u201339 anos), M\/F40 (40\u201349 anos), M\/F50 (50\u201359 anos) e M\/F60 (60+ anos), sendo premiados os 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina. A Caminhada de 4 km \u00e9 aberta a todas as idades.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite da prova e quem organiza o evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Tanto a Corrida de 10 km como a Mini Caminhada de 4 km t\u00eam uma dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima de 2 horas (2h00). O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo Eug\u00e9nios Health & SPA Club (EUG\u00c9NIOS HC) e pela Junta de N\u00facleo do CNE de Famalic\u00e3o, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o e da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69682,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,478,47],"event_type_2":[52,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-68416","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-famalicao-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-sao-silvestre","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-de-famalicao.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68416","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=68416"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68416\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":69699,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68416\/revisions\/69699"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/69682"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=68416